msgid "Specify a fixed amount (e.g. 1.50), percentage (e.g. 1%), or both (e.g. 0.25 + 1.5% or 1.5% + 0.25). Combined fees are applied from left to right, starting with the product total after discounts, excluding shipping. Fee amounts and the percentage base follow the WooCommerce \"Prices entered with tax\" setting. Use a dot (.) for decimals."
